      "text": "Here is the completed accessibility audit:\n\n**Accessibility Audit -- Tutors SvelteKit App**\n\nAcross ~91 source `.svelte` files:\n\n---\n\n**1. ARIA attributes** -- Only 4 files use any ARIA attributes (aria-label/aria-hidden/aria-describedby). One file uses `role=`. That is roughly **4-5% coverage** -- a critical gap.\n\n**2. Semantic HTML** -- `TutorsShell.svelte` correctly uses `<header>`, `<main>`, and `<footer>` landmarks. 15 files total use some semantic elements, but `<nav>` is absent from the main navigation (`MainNavigator.svelte`). No skip-nav link exists.\n\n**3. Focus management** -- Only the search page (`src/routes/(course-reader)/search/[courseid]/+page.svelte`) calls `.focus()` or uses `tabindex`. There is **zero skip-nav**, **zero focus-trap**, and **no focus management on route change**.\n\n**4. Keyboard navigation** -- Only 1 file has `onkeydown` (the search input). All other interactive buttons use native `<button>` elements (good), and no `<div>`/`<span>` elements have click handlers without keyboard equivalents (also good). This area is adequate thanks to semantic button usage.\n\n**5. Images** -- 9 `<img>` tags found; 3 have **empty `alt=\"\"`** on content images that should have descriptive text:\n- `src/lib/ui/learning-objects/layout/Card.svelte` (lines 75, 96) -- card images with no alt\n- `src/lib/ui/time/StudentCard.svelte` (line 101) -- learning object image with no alt\n\n**6. Color contrast / prefers-reduced-motion** -- **Zero** files reference `prefers-reduced-motion`. The app uses `fly`/`slide` transitions in `TutorsShell.svelte` with no reduced-motion guard. No contrast-related utilities found.\n\n**7. Form labels** -- Search page properly uses `<label for=\"search\">`. This is the only form in the app; it is adequate.\n\n**8. Heading hierarchy** -- `h1` appears only in `TutorsInfo.svelte` and `NotFound.svelte`. Most pages jump straight to `h2`. `Card.svelte` uses `h6` for student names, skipping h3-h5. Hierarchy is inconsistent.\n\n**9. Screen reader support** -- **Zero** usage of `sr-only`, `visually-hidden`, or any screen-reader-only utility classes.\n\n---\n\n**Prioritized Gaps (highest impact first):**\n\n1. **No skip-nav link** -- Add to `TutorsShell.svelte` targeting `<main>`\n2. **No route-change focus management** -- SvelteKit `afterNavigate` should move focus to main content\n3. **Missing `<nav>` landmark** on `MainNavigator.svelte`\n4. **No `prefers-reduced-motion`** -- all transitions/animations lack this\n5. **Empty alt on content images** -- `Card.svelte` lines 75/96, `StudentCard.svelte` line 101\n6. **No sr-only utility** -- icons and buttons lack screen-reader-only labels throughout\n7. **Near-zero ARIA usage** -- interactive components like `Menu.svelte`, `Sidebar.svelte`, `CourseSentimentButton.svelte` lack roles/labels\n8. **Broken heading hierarchy** -- pages missing `h1`, jumping levels",
